{
  "_doc": "Watch-list of the data-freshness service (docs/urbanos/DATA_FRESHNESS_SERVICE.md). Projects: what to track and how they are named. Sources: where to look, with tier 1 official / 2 reputable press / 3 other. Edit and commit; every run records this file's sha256.",
